ind":"extracted"},{"field":"capex","statement":"Only Rs 30-35 crore was spent in Q1, though Rs 80 crore was capitalised.","quote":"For quarter 1, we might have spent around INR30 crores -INR35 crores only capex, but overall INR80 crores which is capitalized.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/MTARTECH_06082026204853_Transcript_sw.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"Fuel cell capacity expansion is on track: Phase 1 done, Phase 2 by September-October 2026.","quote":"Our capacity augmentation plan for fuel cells being implemented in three phases remains on track, with Phase 1 already commissioned, Phase 2 to be commissioned by September-October of this year,","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/MTARTECH_06082026204853_Transcript_sw.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"The multifold Phase 3 expansion will be commissioned by March 2027, with ramp-up from April.","quote":"It's going to be commissioning by March '27, the multifold expansion plan, and then we move on to the ramp-up plan afterwards from April onwards.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/MTARTECH_06082026204853_Transcript_sw.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"A dedicated facility is being set up for data centre infrastructure products.","quote":"To support this opportunity, we are also setting up a dedicated facility for data center infrastructure solutions.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/MTARTECH_06082026204853_Transcript_sw.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"orders","statement":"The order book stood at Rs 5,143 crore at quarter end, with Rs 800 crore more received on the call day.","quote":"Our closing order book by end of this quarter already stands at INR5,143 crores, and we have received additional INR800 crores of orders today.","doc_k